Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add BYOK practice quiz feature, AdMob banner ads, Play
 Store readiness fixes

- quiz tab: Groq-powered similar-question generator with live countdown timer and auto-grading, BYOK (each user enters their own Groq key, stored locally)
- AdMob banner ad scaffolding (native), using Google test IDs - swap for real AdMob account IDs before release
- targetSdk 34 -> 36 (Play Store requires 35 now, 36 from Aug 31 2026 - 34 would have blocked submission)
- removed hardcoded keystore password fallback from build.gradle (repo is public)
- added bundleRelease (.aab) step to CI for Play Store upload alongside existing APK release
